    "title": "Inside the Map of 30 Immigrant Enclaves",
    "description": "A look at a 30-entry immigrant-enclaves map: who published it, what it lists, how it differs from an earlier city series, and what remains unestablished.",
    "canonical": "https://knoedg.nyc/inside-the-map-of-30-immigrant-enclaves/",
