    "contentBlocks": [
      {
        "type": "section",
        "id": "nyc-immigrant-enclaves",
        "heading": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Inside the Map of 30 Immigrant Enclaves"
          }
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A map titled “NEW YORK CITY IMMIGRANT ENCLAVES” lists 30 entries and does not include Little Italy. The map was published by "
              },
              {
                "type": "link",
                "href": "https://www.nyctourism.com/worldcup26/the-nyc-neighborhood-passport-world-cup-program/",
                "newWindow": true,
                "accessibleNewWindowText": "opens in a new tab",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "New York City Tourism + Conventions"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ", and the map itself cites the NYC Mayor’s Office of Immigrant Affairs as its data source. No source in this collection identifies the map’s designer."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The Mayor’s Office of Immigrant Affairs launched an Immigrant Enclave Illustration Series on April 17, 2023. In its "
              },
              {
                "type": "link",
                "href": "https://www.nyc.gov/assets/immigrants/downloads/pdf/digital-spread-12-31-2025-moia-impact.pdf",
                "newWindow": true,
                "accessibleNewWindowText": "opens in a new tab",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "end-of-tenure report"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " covering through December 31, 2025, the office states that 23 illustrations were published. Comparing that report with this map shows five names that appear on the map but not in the report: Little Egypt, Little Odessa, Little Palestine, Little Poland and Little Senegal."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "On July 10, 2026, "
              },
              {
                "type": "link",
                "href": "https://www.amny.com/news/little-italy-mamdani-immigrant-map-backlash/",
                "newWindow": true,
                "accessibleNewWindowText": "opens in a new tab",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "amNewYork"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " reported that the mayor’s team had updated the map. At the same press conference, the mayor said the map had been created by the prior administration in 2023 and that future changes would include adding Little Italy. As of August 20, no amended version had been located, and the known map file remained byte-for-byte unchanged from an archived copy captured before the July reporting."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Published "
              },
              {
                "type": "time",
                "pointer": "/issuedAt",
                "format": "datetime"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ". Source pages and files can change after that time."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "section",
            "id": "the-artifact",
            "heading": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The map"
              }
            ],
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "figure",
                "src": "/assets/nyc-immigrant-enclaves-map.jpg",
                "alt": "The NEW YORK CITY IMMIGRANT ENCLAVES map: thirty numbered neighborhoods listed alphabetically with subway access, grouped under five borough headings. Little Italy does not appear.",
                "decorative": false,
                "caption": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "“NEW YORK CITY IMMIGRANT ENCLAVES,” published by New York City Tourism + Conventions. The map lists 30 entries; Little Italy is not included."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The map’s footnote reads “Source: NYC Mayor’s Office of Immigrant Affairs.” That identifies a data source; it does not name the map’s designer. The file carries no designer credit or authorship metadata."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The source image remains available at "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "link",
                    "href": "https://images.ctfassets.net/1aemqu6a6t65/5v68fmavEAod5jBdx4cdko/2d41975edab31488b3772798d1465695/WC_Passport_map.jpg",
                    "newWindow": true,
                    "accessibleNewWindowText": "opens in a new tab",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "the publisher-served image address"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ". The same bytes appear in "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "link",
                    "href": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260617153310id_/https://images.ctfassets.net/1aemqu6a6t65/5v68fmavEAod5jBdx4cdko/2d41975edab31488b3772798d1465695/WC_Passport_map.jpg",
                    "newWindow": true,
                    "accessibleNewWindowText": "opens in a new tab",
                    "content": [
                      {
